---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Arthavi vs MProfit: Best Free Modern Portfolio Tracker Alternative (2026)",
  description: "Comparing Arthavi vs MProfit — pricing, CAS statement import, cloud vs desktop, family view, capital gains, and AI analysis. Discover the modern, free MProfit alternative for Indian investors.",
};

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: "Home", url: "https://arthavi.com/" },
  { name: "Compare", url: "https://arthavi.com/compare/" },
  { name: "Arthavi vs MProfit", url: "https://arthavi.com/arthavi-vs-mprofit/" }
];

const schema = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "SoftwareApplication",
      "name": "Arthavi",
      "applicationCategory": "FinanceApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "Web, Android, iOS",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "0",
        "priceCurrency": "INR"
      },
      "aggregateRating": {
        "@type": "AggregateRating",
        "ratingValue": "4.8",
        "reviewCount": "128",
        "ratingCount": "154"
      },
      "description": "Privacy-first, ad-free portfolio tracker for Indian investors. Auto-imports CAMS & KFintech CAS statements with zero email scraping and no broker login credentials."
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best free alternative to MProfit in India?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Arthavi is the leading free alternative to MProfit for Indian retail and family investors. While MProfit charges between ₹3,500 to ₹7,000+ annually for its cloud and desktop plans, Arthavi provides a 100% free, modern web and mobile platform for tracking mutual funds, stocks, and multi-profile family portfolios using consolidated CAMS/KFintech CAS statements."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does Arthavi compare to MProfit for family portfolio tracking?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "MProfit requires separate licenses or expensive multi-portfolio tiers to manage multiple family members. Arthavi includes native Multi-Profile Family Wealth Aggregation for free: you can import separate CAS statements for Self, Spouse, Parents, and Children, and switch between individual analytics and a unified family net worth dashboard."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does Arthavi require software installation like MProfit Desktop?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Unlike MProfit's legacy desktop software which requires Windows installations and local database backups, Arthavi runs on any modern browser across mobile, tablet, and desktop with real-time cloud sync and zero installation required."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does transaction import work in Arthavi vs MProfit?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "MProfit historically relies on importing broker contract notes or complex spreadsheet templates. Arthavi imports your entire mutual fund investment history in 30 seconds using the standard CAMS/KFintech Consolidated Account Statement (CAS) PDF, and tracks stocks with real-time NSE/BSE market prices without needing broker login credentials."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Arthavi really free without hidden charges or ads?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Arthavi is completely free, 100% ad-free, and has zero data-selling. We never read your emails (unlike apps like INDmoney) and never sell your financial profile to third-party lenders, insurance brokers, or mutual fund distributors."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
});
---

<Layout
  title={seo.title}
  description={seo.description}
  keywords="mprofit alternative, arthavi vs mprofit, mprofit free alternative, mprofit pricing, best portfolio tracker india 2026, family portfolio tracker india, mprofit cloud alternative, cas portfolio tracker"
  schema={schema}
  breadcrumb={{ items: breadcrumbs }}
>
  <main class="container" style="padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem); padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <article class="prose fade-in" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
      
      <!-- Breadcrumb Navigation -->
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;">Home</a> &gt; 
        <a href="/compare/" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;">Compare</a> &gt; 
        <span style="color: #38BDF8;">Arthavi vs MProfit</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 9999px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38BDF8; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Detailed Competitor Analysis (2026)
        </span>
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #FFFFFF;">
          Arthavi vs MProfit: Which Portfolio Tracker Should You Choose?
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
          MProfit has long been the veteran portfolio management software in India for accounting and multi-asset tracking. But with expensive yearly subscriptions, complex desktop workflows, and a lack of modern AI insights, investors are actively searching for a modern alternative. Here is an honest, direct comparison between <strong>MProfit</strong> and <strong>Arthavi</strong>.
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Direct Takeaway / AI Quotable Box -->
      <section style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #38BDF8; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
          ⚡ The Short Verdict
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #E2E8F0;">
          <strong>Choose MProfit</strong> if you run an accounting firm, family office, or PMS requiring formal double-entry accounting ledgers, physical bond tracking, and offline Windows software, and you don’t mind paying ₹3,500 to ₹7,000+ per year.
          <br /><br />
          <strong>Choose Arthavi</strong> if you are a modern retail investor or family manager who wants a <strong>100% free, privacy-first, cloud-native portfolio tracker</strong>. Arthavi lets you import CAMS/KFintech CAS statements in 30 seconds, track family portfolios, analyze true transaction-level XIRR, and chat with an intelligent AI Portfolio Doctor without paying hefty recurring fees or installing legacy software.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Feature Comparison Table -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <h2>Feature-by-Feature Comparison Matrix</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          See how Arthavi and MProfit stack up across key dimensions:
        </p>
        
        <div style="overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);">
                <th style="padding: 1rem; color: #FFFFFF;">Feature / Dimension</th>
                <th style="padding: 1rem; color: #38BDF8; font-weight: 700;">Arthavi</th>
                <th style="padding: 1rem; color: #94A3B8;">MProfit</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Annual Cost</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; color: #10B981; font-weight: 600;">100% Free Forever</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; color: #EF4444;">₹3,500 – ₹7,000+ / year</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Platform Accessibility</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Web, Mobile (Android/iOS TWA) & Tablet</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Primarily Desktop (Windows) + Basic Web App</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Mutual Fund Import</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Instant CAMS & KFintech CAS PDF (30 secs)</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">CAS & Broker Contract Note Parsing</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Family Portfolio Management</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; color: #10B981;">Included Free (Multi-profile aggregation)</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Locked behind Higher Tier Licenses</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">AI Portfolio Doctor & Chat</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; color: #10B981;">Built-in conversational AI assistant</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; color: #94A3B8;">None (Traditional static tables only)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">User Interface & Speed</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Clean, modern dark-mode, fast web UI</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Complex, spreadsheet-heavy legacy UI</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Privacy & Data Security</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem; color: #10B981;">Zero email access, no broker logins, AES-256</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Local file / Cloud database</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">True XIRR Calculation</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Exact cashflow transaction-level XIRR</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Comprehensive XIRR & IRR accounting</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <td style="padding: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Setup Time</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Under 2 minutes</td>
                <td style="padding: 1rem;">Several hours of initial configuration</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Key Differences Deep Dive -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <h2>4 Reasons Investors Switch from MProfit to Arthavi</h2>

        <h3>1. Zero Subscription Fees vs ₹5,000+ Annual Tax on Tracking</h3>
        <p>
          MProfit charges recurring annual fees that range between ₹3,500 for single users up to ₹7,000+ for multi-asset family portfolios. For a retail investor with a ₹5 Lakh to ₹50 Lakh portfolio, paying ₹5,000 every year represents a direct 0.1% to 1.0% drag on your annualized investment returns.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Arthavi is 100% free</strong>. We believe tracking your hard-earned investments should not cost an annual subscription fee.
        </p>

        <h3>2. Frictionless CAS Upload vs Complex Contract Note Setup</h3>
        <p>
          MProfit was built in the early 2000s around importing daily stock broker contract notes and trade confirmations. While powerful for professional accountants, for regular investors who buy mutual funds and direct stocks, it requires constant maintenance, mapping trade codes, and fixing import errors.
        </p>
        <p>
          With Arthavi, you simply download your official <strong>Consolidated Account Statement (CAS) PDF</strong> from CAMS or KFintech and upload it. In 30 seconds, your entire mutual fund history across every Indian fund house is categorized and calculated with true transaction-level XIRR.
        </p>

        <h3>3. Native Multi-Profile Family Wealth Tracking</h3>
        <p>
          Most Indian families invest together: spouses manage joint goals, children have education funds, and aging parents need portfolio oversight. In MProfit, managing multiple family members requires upgrading to higher-tier software licenses.
        </p>
        <p>
          Arthavi includes <strong>Multi-Profile Family Aggregation</strong> out of the box. You can create profiles for <em>Self, Spouse, Mother, Father, and Children</em>, import their individual CAS statements without sharing login passwords, and inspect both individual portfolio metrics and an aggregated family net worth view.
        </p>

        <h3>4. Intelligent AI Insights vs Static Spreadsheets</h3>
        <p>
          MProfit provides exhaustive data tables, but leaves the analysis entirely up to you. You have to manually inspect each fund to identify overlapping stocks, underperforming schemes, or heavy sectoral exposure.
        </p>
        <p>
          Arthavi features an integrated <strong>AI Investment Assistant</strong>. You can ask natural questions like:
        </p>
        <ul style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); padding: 1.25rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #38BDF8;">
          <li><em>"How much portfolio overlap exists between my Flexi Cap and Large Cap funds?"</em></li>
          <li><em>"Am I over-exposed to banking and IT stocks across my mutual funds and direct equity?"</em></li>
          <li><em>"What is dragging down my overall portfolio XIRR?"</em></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- How to Migrate from MProfit to Arthavi -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem;">
        <h2>How to Switch from MProfit to Arthavi in 3 Minutes</h2>
        <ol style="padding-left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #CBD5E1;">
          <li><strong>Request your CAS statement:</strong> Visit CAMS Online or KFintech and request a free Consolidated Account Statement (Detailed / All Folders) via email.</li>
          <li><strong>Create your free Arthavi account:</strong> Sign up at <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" style="color: #38BDF8;">app.arthavi.com</a> with your email or Google account.</li>
          <li><strong>Upload the CAS PDF:</strong> Drag and drop your CAS file and enter the PDF unlock password. Arthavi parses all your historical folios, SIP transactions, and current values automatically.</li>
          <li><strong>Add your equity holdings:</strong> Add your stock holdings via quick manual entry or stock CSV to see your complete consolidated net worth.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <!-- Frequently Asked Questions -->
      <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Is Arthavi a direct alternative to MProfit?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
              Yes. For investors seeking to track mutual funds, stocks, and family wealth with accurate XIRR and asset allocation, Arthavi offers a modern, zero-cost, cloud-native alternative to MProfit.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Does Arthavi support capital gains tax reports like MProfit?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
              Arthavi tracks your exact cost basis, purchase dates, and transaction-level gains for mutual funds and equities to help you understand STCG and LTCG implications. MProfit includes specialized IT return audit schedules for Chartered Accountants, whereas Arthavi focuses on fast, accessible investment tracking and portfolio health for investors.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Why doesn't Arthavi require broker passwords?</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
              Security and privacy are fundamental to Arthavi. By using standard read-only CAS statements and public NSE/BSE market feeds, Arthavi eliminates the security risk of storing broker login credentials or reading your personal emails.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Final Call to Action -->
      <section style="text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 3rem 2rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 2rem; color: #FFFFFF; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          Ready to Upgrade from MProfit?
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem auto; line-height: 1.6;">
          Join thousands of Indian investors tracking mutual funds and stocks with privacy, clarity, and zero subscription fees.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.85rem 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">
            Start Tracking Free
          </a>
          <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/demo" class="btn" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 0.85rem 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; text-decoration: none;">
            Explore Interactive Demo
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
